/* Privacy */
"连接观察全部在你的手机里完成。联网仅用于设备注册、服务解读、购买验证和白名单下载。" = "All connection analysis happens on your phone. The app goes online only for device registration, Service insight, purchase verification, and whitelist downloads.";
"记录什么" = "What we record";
"目标 IP、端口、域名、上下行字节数、连接时间。" = "Destination IPs, ports, domains, per-connection byte counts, and timestamps.";
"不记录什么" = "What we don’t record";
"聊天内容、账号、密码、图片、文件、浏览记录。" = "Message content, accounts, passwords, images, files, or browsing history.";
"保存在哪里" = "Where it’s stored";
"只在本次会话的内存里，不写入磁盘。关闭 VPN 或点「清空记录」即释放。" = "Only in memory for this session — never written to disk. Stopping the VPN or tapping “Clear records” frees it.";
"联网与上传" = "Network access";
"本机连接记录永不上传。联网只发生在这几种情况：
① 设备注册——首次使用联网功能时发送平台、应用版本和设备公钥，经 App Attest（iOS）/ Play Integrity（Android）验证真实性，仅用于签发访问凭证；
② 服务解读——把你选择的那一个域名或 IP 发送给查询服务器，由服务器转交 AI 模型分析；
③ 购买验证——购买凭证发送给查询服务器核验额度；
④ 白名单——启动时从服务器下载过滤规则。
这些请求都不会携带你的连接记录。" = "Local connection records are never uploaded. The app only goes online in these cases:
① Device registration — on first use of an online feature the app sends the platform, app version, and a device public key, verified by App Attest (iOS) / Play Integrity (Android), used only to issue access credentials;
② Service insight — the single domain or IP you choose is sent to our lookup server, which forwards it to an AI model for analysis;
③ Purchase verification — receipts are sent to the server to verify your entitlement;
④ Whitelist — filter rules are downloaded from the server at launch.
None of these requests carries your connection records.";
"第三方 SDK" = "Third-party SDKs";
"无统计、无广告、无埋点。IP 归属地使用随安装包内置的离线数据库；服务解读由 AI 模型生成，模型只会收到你查询的那一个地址。" = "No analytics, ads, or tracking. IP geolocation uses an offline database bundled in the app. Service insight is produced by an AI model that only receives the single address you queried.";
"位置权限" = "Location permission";
"只有大致位置，仅用于在地图上标出你的起点，不保存、不上传。可随时在系统设置中关闭。" = "Approximate location only, used solely to mark your starting point on the map. Never saved or uploaded; you can revoke it in system settings anytime.";
"VPN 权限" = "VPN permission";
"系统只允许通过 VPN 接口读取连接信息，这是本应用申请它的唯一用途：流量原样转发，不做拦截、不改内容。" = "The VPN interface is the only way the system lets an app see connection metadata — its sole purpose here. Traffic is forwarded unchanged: no blocking, no modification.";
